Subject: [#94-1-541] META: Will we ever get along?

Ray quite rightly says:

> Why is it that we can't stay and negotiate our problems instead of
> running away? [..]  We are going to run into big problems in the
> future with accepted paradigms, so we better resolve the problems
> among ourselves first. [...] you don't have to unsubscribe -- stay
